                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a3d8ae16-ae44-4d98-826e-78a7ffecd43a",
                                "sense_id": "ea70c3b5-ea0b-37f0-92b1-b8f1f999c6c2",
                                "text": "Was Pokrovsky's view of the differences between history and sociology regarded as more \"schematist\" than that which was introduced following Stalin's \"Observations\"?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b42e62cd-e5ca-4092-8110-3d44967fbfd8",
                                "sense_id": "ea70c3b5-ea0b-37f0-92b1-b8f1f999c6c2",
                                "text": "Such a schematist approach and methods have always proved restrictive and conducive to some dogma or other."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "43b6f2be-c9e5-4bc2-9135-aa3d3b6ec819",
                                "sense_id": "ea70c3b5-ea0b-37f0-92b1-b8f1f999c6c2",
                                "text": "A review of linguistics illustrated the concepts transplanted into IT applications are predominantly schematist -- based on abstract formal models ."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
